OL,3,GNEWSASafety barrier at derelict
OL,4,Abuilding an 'absolute eyesore'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have raised disruption
OL,7,Fconcerns over an "eyesore" safety
OL,8,Fbarrier erected at a derelict building
OL,9,Fin Belfast city centre.
OL,11,FThe metal fencing has closed off a
OL,12,Fsection of the footpath on Donegall
OL,13,FStreet and limited part of it to a
OL,14,Fsingle lane of traffic.
OL,16,FThe disused building forms part of the
OL,17,Fcontroversial Tribeca project - a
OL,18,F12-acre site that has become
OL,19,Fincreasingly run down after a decade of
OL,20,Flittle progress.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
