OL,3,GNEWSASafety barrier at derelict
OL,4,Abuilding an 'absolute eyesore'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's Department for
OL,7,FInfrastructure (DfI) said the road was
OL,8,Fpartially closed "on safety grounds",
OL,9,Fwhile Belfast City Council said it was
OL,10,F"liaising with the owner to determine
OL,11,Fappropriate next steps".
